<th>GIA Equivalent</th>
<th>GCAL Equivalent</th>
<th>Eye-Clean in Emerald Cut?</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td>VVS1</td><td>VS1–VS2</td><td>VS1</td><td>Yes — very safe</td></tr>
<tr><td>VVS2</td><td>VS1–VS2</td><td>VS1–VS2</td><td>Yes — safe minimum</td></tr>
